      ],
      "en": "After these things, when the wrath of King Ahasuerus was pacified, he remembered Vashti, and what she had done, and what was decreed against her.",
      "ko": "그 후에 아하수에로왕의 노가 그치매 와스디와 그의 행한 일과 그에 대하여 내린 조서를 생각하거늘",
      "source_text_hash": "c0a6c031d6c65a97d35d4fd6738be3754bf19d5414955d59b159708743929263",
      "translation_text_hash": "5e09c3b8afd745c2126422526803d9d97b27f08878d19833b795ac926eab1c95",
