      "en": "Mordecai walked every day in front of the court of the women’s house, to find out how Esther was doing, and what would become of her.",
      "ko": "모르드개가 날마다 후궁 뜰 앞으로 왕래하며 에스더의 안부와 어떻게 될 것을 알고자 하더라",
      "source_text_hash": "a4a9cb9c733c2a951c1a60232d8e773a1e542b5ba03c8adc02a73728b7940cf5",
      "translation_text_hash": "791a66881be1214d1aff476f9dc536420bee6af9b4b93ef1703d5ab7f28639d8",
