      "en": "So Esther was taken to King Ahasuerus into his royal house in the tenth month, which is the month Tebeth, in the seventh year of his reign.",
      "ko": "아하수에로왕의 칠년 시월 곧 데벳월에 에스더가 이끌려 왕궁에 들어가서 왕의 앞에 나아가니",
      "source_text_hash": "6dbaefc870ff8aacf887103d70beaf8c7769af05cba40074c94ea6d55f8e77c5",
      "translation_text_hash": "b276603bc7c1859764424669994191423a6b0384e128703ff212897f98f17b4d",
